{"3817070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cubin II", "steam_appid": 3817070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3817080], "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Cubin II</i></strong> is a first-person puzzle-platformer game that is the sequel to <i>Cubin</i>.<br>You are immersed once again in the LGA experience, but this time on the other side of things, at the moment when everything changed after your victory. You quickly discover a new way to escape from this hell. During the 50 new experiments to solve, you will once again be accompanied by Alice, and you will have to team up to move forward together.<br><br>In this alternate world, each experiment becomes more difficult, and the mechanics are more advanced.<br>Discover new ways to propel yourself, move through the darkness, wield the cube, and even think and explore. Think carefully and surpass yourself during these final trials, but be careful, because no missteps will be tolerated...<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817070/extras/6e571bf7454f42d803d6966f68bc3efc.avif?t=1777536063\" width=599 height=149 /></span><br><br><strong><u>Game features</u></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Complete 50 complex experiments<br></li><li>New gameplay mechanics<br></li><li>Different endings<br></li><li>A rich storyline and puzzles<br></li><li>Use the control room to get an overview of the experiment and also allows events to be triggered<br></li><li>Multiple new events to be triggered during the experiments<br></li><li>Team up with Alice, you must help each other get out of this experiment<br></li><li>Easy to learn and fully customizable</li></ul><br><br><i>It is recommended that you complete the first story before starting this one.</i>", "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Cubin II</i></strong> is a first-person puzzle-platformer game that is the sequel to <i>Cubin</i>.